        "hash": "abac2d581153d6162c7b7e9e5af84fdb4b1d89f3",
        "subject": "Stop the privacy notice covering every screen in mobile e2e",
        "body": "Stop the privacy notice covering every screen in mobile e2e\n\nThe /user_settings mock omitted analytics_notice_seen_at, so\nAnalyticsPrivacyNotice rendered in every logged-in spec. It is a bottom sheet\nover the composer and tab bar, and it is accessibilityViewIsModal, so clicks\nunderneath it were intercepted — assistant.spec.ts \"typing a custom message\"\nfailed with the notice body swallowing the Enviar press.\n\nFixed in the mock rather than by dismissing it per-spec: no spec is testing the\nnotice, and a dismiss step would add a wait to every login. Specs that do want\nit can override the route.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n",
        "author": {
          "name": "Nived Vengilat",
          "email": "nivedvengilat@gmail.com",
          "time": 1786584497000
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "Nived Vengilat",
          "email": "nivedvengilat@gmail.com",
          "time": 1786584497000
        },
        "branch": "HEAD"
      },
